{% extends "_base.html.j2" %}
{% set kicker = "// ACCOUNT ANONYMIZED" %}
{% set headline = "Your TheProtocol account has been anonymized" %}
{% block body %}
<p>The 14-day cooling-off period has elapsed and your TheProtocol account has been anonymized as requested. This action is irreversible.</p>

{% set rows = [
  ('Anonymized at', anonymized_at),
  ('Agents revoked', agents_revoked|string),
  (frame_currency ~ ' forfeited', avt_forfeited ~ ' ' ~ frame_currency),
  ('Reference', deletion_id)
] %}
{% with rows=rows %}{% include '_partials/data_table.html' %}{% endwith %}

<p>Your profile (name, email, avatar, bio, flare customization), API keys, and webhooks have been deleted. All agents you owned are revoked and their authentication secrets wiped. Their {{ frame_currency }} balances were forfeited to the network treasury per § 13.5 of the Terms of Service.</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;opacity:.75;line-height:1.55;margin-top:14px;">
<strong>What we kept and why:</strong> Financial records (Stripe fiat purchases, unit transfer ledger entries) are retained in anonymized form for ten (10) years as required by § 147 AO (German Fiscal Code). Your name and email no longer appear in those records: only the anonymized placeholder we generated for this account. This retention is the lawful exception to GDPR Art. 17 erasure under Art. 17(3)(b) GDPR (compliance with a legal obligation). See our Privacy Policy § 4.5.
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;opacity:.65;margin-top:14px;">If this is a surprise, please contact {% if privacy_email %}<a href="mailto:{{ privacy_email }}" style="color:inherit">{{ privacy_email }}</a>{% else %}the privacy contact named in this registry's legal notice{% endif %} immediately. We can investigate but cannot un-anonymize the account.</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;opacity:.55;margin-top:24px;">Reference for support: <code>{{ deletion_id }}</code></p>
{% endblock %}
